<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: Share capital increases from exercise of share options in 2024, 2025 and 2026</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2026-06-17 18:35:31</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA hereby announces three share capital increases by monetary contribution related to the exercise of share options. The capital increases were registered with the Norwegian Register of Business Enterprises on the following dates:<br><br>-	17 December 2024: 9,897 shares issued (from 72,650,539 to 72,660,436 shares)<br>-	10 July 2025: 68,245 shares issued (from 72,660,436 to 72,728,681 shares)<br>-	18 February 2026: 26,298 shares issued (from 72,728,681 to 72,754,979 shares)<br><br>The share options are exercised in accordance with the terms of the company’s stock option plan.<br><br>Following the issuance of the new shares, the share capital of Aprila Bank ASA is NOK 72,754,979 divided into 72,754,979 shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 1 and representing one vote at the Company's general meetings.<br><br>For further information, please contact:<br><br>Espen Engelberg, CFO<br>+47 954 55 405<br>espen@aprila.no</p></td>
</tr>
