<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA reports the interim results for the first quarter of 2026 on 13 May 2026. A recorded presentation will be published at 08:00 CEST on aprila.no/investor-relations. <br><br>There will be no live Q&A session. Questions can be submitted to ir@aprila.no and will be answered directly. Both questions and answers will be published on our Q&A page.<br><br>Date: 13 May 2026<br>Time: 08:00 CEST<br>Subscribe to our financial news: https://www.aprila.no/content/investor-relations<br>Q&A page: https://www.aprila.no/content/investor-relations/qa<br><br>The Q1 26 interim report and presentation will be available on aprila.no/investor-relations prior to the presentation at 08:00.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Espen Engelberg, CFO<br>+47 954 55 405<br>espen@aprila.no</p></td>
