<td colspan="3"><p>Disruptor AS, an investment company wholly owned by Israr Khan, Chief Product & Technology Officer in Aprila Bank ASA (“Aprila”), has on 27 November 2024 purchased 10,289 shares in Aprila from Israr Khan. The shares were purchased at NOK 6.37 per share. After the purchase, Israr Khan holds all his shares through his wholly owned investment company, a total of 760,289 shares in Aprila, equal to 1.0% of the share capital.</p></td>
