</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA reports the interim results for the fourth quarter of 2023 on 13 February 2024. A presentation will be broadcasted at 10:00 CET. Please register your attendance using the link below.<br><br>The presentation will not be followed by a Q&A session, but questions can be submitted to ir@aprila.no and will be answered directly.<br><br>A recording of the presentation will be made available on aprila.no/investor-relations.<br><br>Date: 13 February 2024<br>Time: 10:00 CET<br>Registration link: https://www.aprila.no/content/investor-relations/register<br><br>The Q4 23 interim report and presentation will be available on aprila.no/investor-relations prior to the broadcast at 10:00.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
</tr>
