<td colspan="3"><p>ØSD Invest AS, an investment company wholly owned by Øystein Dannevig, Chief Decision Scientist in Aprila Bank ASA (“Aprila”), has on 16 November 2023 purchased 100,000 shares in Aprila. The shares were purchased at a volume-weighted average share price of NOK 6.10 per share. After the purchase, Øystein Dannevig holds, directly and through his wholly owned investment company, a total of 1,134,398 shares in Aprila, equal to 1.72% of the share capital.</p></td>
