<td colspan="3"><p>Pippen Holding AS, an investment company wholly owned by Christian Lunde, Chief Credit Officer in Aprila Bank ASA (“Aprila”), has on 15 November 2023 purchased 25,500 shares in Aprila. The shares were purchased at NOK 6.00 per share. After the purchase, Christian Lunde holds, directly and through his wholly owned investment company, a total of 50,000 shares in Aprila, equal to 0.08% of the share capital.</p></td>
