<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: Annual report 2022</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2023-03-29 16:05:42</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The company’s annual report for 2022 and the company’s Pillar 3 report for 2022 are now published on https://www.aprila.no/investor-relations.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
