<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: Notification of trade</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2023-03-07 11:21:20</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Christian Lunde, Chief Credit Officer in Aprila Bank ASA, has on 7 March 2023 purchased 500 shares in Aprila Bank ASA. The shares were purchased at NOK 5.50 per share. After the purchase, Christian Lunde holds 24,500 shares in the company, equal to 0.04% of the share capital.</p></td>
