</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to the announcement made by Aprila Bank ASA (the "Company") on 26 October 2022, regarding the exercise of warrants for 187,500 new shares.<br><br>The share capital increase pertaining to this share issuance has now been registered with the Norwegian Register of Business Enterprises.<br><br>Following the registration, the Company's new share capital is NOK 61,812,246, divided into 61,812,246 shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 1 and representing one vote at the Company's general meetings.<br><br>For further information, please contact:<br><br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
</tr>
