</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>SES AS, represented in the board by Bertel Steen, has on 7 November 2022 purchased 50,000 shares in Aprila Bank ASA. The shares were purchased at NOK 7.40 per share. After the purchase, SES AS holds 12,300,000 shares in the company, equal to 19.96% of the share capital.</p></td>
