<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to the extraordinary general meeting in Aprila Bank ASA (the “Company”) held on 10 November 2017 where 187,500 warrants with a strike price of NOK 5.50 per share and a duration of 5 years were issued. The Company has today received a notification of exercise of warrants for 187,500 new shares in Aprila with a strike price of NOK 5.50 per new share (the “Warrants”). Net proceeds to the Company amount to NOK 1,031,250.<br><br>Following the exercise of the Warrants, the number of outstanding warrants in the Company is 0.<br><br>Following the registration of the new share capital pursuant to the exercise of the Warrants, the Company’s share capital will be NOK 61,812,246 divided into 61,812,246 shares, each with a par value of NOK 1,00 and representing one vote at the Company’s general meetings.<br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>Kjetil S. Barli<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
