<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: New share capital registered</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2022-05-12 12:12:07</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to the announcement made by Aprila Bank ASA (the "Company") on 4 March 2022, regarding the exercise of 42,138 options, pursuant to the company’s stock option plan which was authorised by the ordinary general meeting in the company on 29 April 2021.<br><br>The share capital increase pertaining to this share issuance has now been registered with the Norwegian Register of Business Enterprises.<br><br>Following the registration, the Company's new share capital is NOK 50,633,610, divided into 50,633,610 shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 1 and representing one vote at the Company's general meetings.<br><br>For further information, please contact:<br><br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
