<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA reports the interim results for the fourth quarter on 14 February 2022. A presentation will be broadcasted live through the link below. The presentation will be followed by a Q&A session.<br><br>Date: 14 February 2022<br>Time: 10:00 CET<br>Link: https://events.webcast.no/viewer-registration/JV6KQdUb/register <br><br>The presentation will be available on the company's website:<br>https://www.aprila.no/investor-relations<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
