<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA reports the interim results for the third quarter on 12 November 2021. A presentation will be held at Pareto Securities’ premises in Dronning Mauds Gate 3. The presentation can also be attended virtually on Teams Live.<br><br>Date: 12 November 2021<br>Time: 10:00 CET<br><br>Location: <br>Pareto Securities Offices, Dronning Mauds Gate 3, 11th floor, Oslo<br><br>Or<br><br>Virtual – Teams Live.<br><br>Please register your attendance in advance by sending an e-mail to events.no@paretosec.com. <br><br>An invitation with Teams Live attendee link will be sent to all virtually registered participants in advance of the presentation.<br><br>The presentation will be available on the company's website:<br>https://www.aprila.no/investor-relations<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
