</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Blue Mountain Capital AS, a company controlled by CFO Kjetil S. Barli, has on 6 September purchased 10,000 shares in Aprila Bank ASA. The shares were purchased at NOK 5.45 per share.<br><br>After the purchase Blue Mountain Capital AS holds 540,000 shares in the company.</p></td>
