<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA has been notified by Trond Kristian Andreassen that he has decided to resign as a member of the board of directors of the company. The decision is not related to company specific issues. The board would like to thank Trond Kristian for his valuable contribution to the development of Aprila Bank.</p></td>
