</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA reports the interim results for the second quarter on 12 August 2021. A presentation will be held as a meeting in Microsoft Teams.<br><br>Date: 12 August 2021<br>Time: 10:00 CET<br><br>Please register your attendance in advance by sending an e-mail to ir@aprila.no. The link to the meeting will be distributed when your attendance is registered.<br><br>The presentation will be available on the company's website:<br>https://www.aprila.no/investor-relations<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
