<td colspan="3"><p>Vimar AS, a company controlled by board member Trond Kristian Andreassen, has on 12 May purchased 115,466 shares in Aprila Bank ASA. The shares were purchased at NOK 4.00 per share.<br><br>After the purchase Vimar AS holds 365,466 shares in the company.</p></td>
