<td colspan="3"><p>The annual report for 2020 is now available on the company's website:<br><br>https://aprila.no/investor-relations.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
