<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila will present the Q4 results today, 12 February 2021, at 10:00 CET. The presentation will be held in Microsoft Teams.<br><br>The report and presentation are available on the company’s website:<br><br>https://www.aprila.no/investor-relations<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
