<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: New share capital registered</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2021-01-07 12:44:55</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Share capital increase by monetary contribution related to exercise of share options by employees to subscribe for 40,442 shares and resolution to increase the share capital dated 7 December 2020 has now been registered with the Norwegian Register of Business Enterprises.<br><br>The share options are exercised in accordance with the terms of the employee stock option plan.<br><br>Following the issuance of the new shares, the share capital of Aprila Bank ASA is NOK 44,630,915 divided into 44,630,915 shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 1 and representing one vote at the Company's general meetings.<br><br>For further information, please contact:<br><br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
</tr>
