<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila will present the Q2 results today, 14 August 2020, at 11:00 CET. The presentation will be held in Microsoft Teams and can be joined via this link: https://bit.ly/30CIXdX.<br><br>The report and presentation are available on the company’s website:<br>https://aprila.no/om-aprila/investor-relations/.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
