<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2020-08-07 15:03:41</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA reports the interim results for the second quarter on 14 August 2020. A presentation will be held as a meeting in Microsoft Teams.<br><br>Date: 14 August 2020<br>Time: 11:00 CET<br>Link: https://bit.ly/30CIXdX<br><br>Please register your attendance upfront by sending an e-mail to ir@aprila.no.<br><br>The presentation will be available on the company's website:<br>https://aprila.no/om-aprila/investor-relations/<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>+47 908 42 016<br>kjetil@aprila.no</p></td>
