<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA has on 20 May convened an extraordinary general meeting which will be held on 5 June 2020 at 10:00 CET at the company’s premises in Kirkegata 5, Oslo.<br><br>Due to the Covid-19 social distancing measures in force, shareholders are encouraged to refrain from attending in person, and participate by means of advance electronic voting or by granting a proxy.<br><br>The notice of the extraordinary general meeting with attachments is available on aprila.no/gf.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>tel: +47 908 42 016<br>email: ir@aprila.no</p></td>
