<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: Annual general meeting 2020</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2020-04-15 10:32:08</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA has today convened its annual general meeting which will be held on 29 April 2020 at 10:00 CET at the company’s premises in Kirkegata 5, Oslo.<br><br>Due to the Covid-19 social distancing measures in force, shareholders are encouraged to refrain from attending in person, and participate by means of advance electronic voting or by granting a proxy.<br><br>The notice of the annual general meeting with attachments is available on aprila.no/gf.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>tel: +47 908 42 016<br>email: ir@aprila.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
