</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA reports the interim results for the fourth quarter on 14 February 2020. A presentation will be held at Pareto Securities’ premises in Dronning Mauds gate 3, 8th floor at 09.00.<br><br>Please register your attendance with Henriette Christensen at henriette@paretosec.com.<br><br>The presentation will be available on the company's website:<br><br>https://aprila.no/om-aprila/investor-relations/<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO, tel: +47 908 42 016</p></td>
