</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: Exercise of options</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2019-11-18 17:00:39</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Employees in Aprila Bank ASA have 15 November 2019 exercised 37,056 options, pursuant to the company’s stock option plan which was authorised by the ordinary general meeting in the company on 30 April 2019.<br><br>In addition to the strike price, the employees shall reimburse the social security tax to the company.<br><br>Options exercised by primary insiders:<br><br>Øystein Dannevig has exercised 34,398 options in the company, corresponding to 34,398 shares at a strike price of NOK 1.<br><br>New holding:<br><br>After exercising options, Øystein Dannevig holds 118 020 unexercised options in the company, corresponding to 118 020 shares, of which 46 032 options have a strike price of NOK 6.50 and 71 988 options have a strike price of NOK 7.00.<br><br>As of today the primary insider holds 800,000 shares in the company through the company ØSD Finans AS.</p></td>
</tr>
