</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>The annual report for 2018 (in Norwegian) is now available at https://aprila.no/investor-relations/.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>tel: +47 908 42 016<br>email: ir@aprila.no</p></td>
