<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: Interim results Q4 2018</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2019-02-26 08:47:12</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Q4 2018 is the third operating quarter for Aprila Bank, and the second quarter the bank is fully operational, following the launch in Tripletex on 26 June.<br><br>Highlights from the third operating quarter:<br><br>- Solid growth in purchased amount; from NOK 36.5 million in Q3 to NOK 100.3 million In Q4<br>- Sound margin expansion; from 2.32% in Q3 to 2.60% in Q4<br>- Increased conversion rate; from ~16% in Q3 to ~18% in Q4<br><br>Aprila Bank offers automated financing solutions to small and medium-sized businesses through partners.<br><br>With the launch of the bank’s first product, Aprila Invoice Sales, we have set a new standard in liquidity financing for Norwegian businesses. Aprila Invoice Sales represents the first fully digital solution for spot sale of invoices in the Norwegian market. Customer onboarding is done digitally, directly in partner channels, and only takes a few minutes to complete. Aprila Invoice Sales is seamlessly incorporated into customers’ existing work flows and funds are paid the following business day at the latest.<br><br>Aprila will present the Q4 results today, Feburary 26th, at 09:00 CET at Pareto Securities’ premises in Dronning Mauds gate 3.<br><br>The report and presentation are attached to this notice and will be made available at https://aprila.no/investor-relations/.<br><br>Contact person at Aprila Bank ASA:<br>Kjetil Barli, CFO<br>tel: +47 908 42 016<br>email: ir@aprila.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
<a href="/public/news/18312.pdf">
Aprila Bank ASA - 2018 Q4.pdf</a>
<br>
<a href="/public/news/18312_2.pdf">
Aprila Bank ASA - 2018 Q4 presentation.pdf</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: Invitation to presentation of Q4 2018</h2></td>
