<td><h2>Aprila Bank ASA: New share capital registered</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2019-01-24 13:33:44</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Reference is made to the announcement made by Aprila Bank ASA (the "Company") on 18 November 2018, regarding exercise of options under the Fixed Salary Options program.<br><br>The share capital increase pertaining to this share issuance has now been registered with the Norwegian Register of Business Enterprises.<br><br>The Company's new share capital is NOK 36,220,084, divided into 36,220,084 shares, each with a nominal value of NOK 1 and representing one vote at the Company's general meetings.</p></td>
</tr>
