<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>APRILA: Aprila Bank ASA is registered on the NOTC-list</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2018-10-19 08:04:24</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Aprila Bank ASA is registered on the NOTC-list as of 19 October 2018 with ticker code APRILA.  The company has issued 36,182,727 shares each with a par value NOK 1.00, all of which are registered in the VPS with ISIN code NO 001 0816473. Based on the last traded price, the market capitalization is NOK 253,279,089 (NOK 7.00 per share). The company has entered into an agreement whereby it will be able to use the NOTC reporting system as from 19 October 2018.<br><br>Aprila Bank is a digital bank for small and medium sized businesses. The bank’s strategy is to integrate its services with business systems the customer already uses through the bank’s own API’s. Aprila is built on a modern and scalable tech architecture and launched its services inside the cloud based ERP system Tripletex in June 2018. This enables real-time pricing, automatic booking in the accounting system, and offerings based on insights into the customer’s accounts. Data and analysis enables continuous improvement in predicting credit outcomes, optimizing pricing and uncovering unwanted behavior. Aprila Bank is probably the first bank in the world to build an API for financing, and to integrate financing inside accounting systems.<br><br>Please see attached Company Presentation</p></td>
</tr>
